  "message": "Import each row in a savepoint while preserving the caller’s transaction.",
  "rationale": "Flushes preexisting pending changes before isolating each insert, catching only IntegrityError and reporting actual successful IDs. Explicitly begins SQLite’s underlying transaction when needed so releasing savepoints cannot prevent a later caller rollback from undoing the inserts.",
  "files": [
